{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"5f4d final validation and review: full held-out oracle expanded to 31 behavioral tests. Independent five-axis review found symlink disclosure, excluded-tree traversal, Makefile text-only proof, and per-line path-scope performance. RED reproduced both symlink leaks; implementation now uses top-down os.walk with excluded-directory pruning, skips symlink dirs/files, and computes bare-token scope once per file. Real isolated root-Makefile make lint injection passes. Guard runtime improved from about 6.15s to 0.56s. Reviewer final verdict APPROVE with no Critical/Required findings. make check green; exact final full suite 7421 passed, 29 skipped, 17 warnings in 7m15s; protected O-RAN/editor diff against a475e24 exits 0. Optional undecodable-file and hostile-line diagnostic hardening recorded as task 8b6c-7583-3e65-4834 linked discovered_from. TokenSave review saved approximately 17044 tokens."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785275238067762001,"uuid":"dd7c25d7-cc39-4df7-a2cd-2730e543390d"}